# Raw scrape archive — must NEVER be committed (public repo)
scrape/

node_modules/
dist/
.DS_Store
*.log

# Owner-supplied raw assets (patient photos, docs) — never ship raw
owner-assets/

# Local admin test pages — __harness.html is a copy of admin/index.html wired to
# a mocked GitHub API, __devices.html racks it up in real phone viewports. Neither
# may reach admin/ on a public site, and both are one `git add -A` away from doing
# so, so the whole `__` prefix is fenced rather than left to stay untracked.
admin/__*.html

# Glyph outlines extracted from the licensed Exotc350 face so the campaign
# renderer can draw the wordmark (its librsvg ignores @font-face, so the face
# cannot be set as text). Shipping outlines from a licensed font in a public repo
# is shipping the font; regenerate locally with the advisor's tools/brand/glyphs.py.
assets/campaign/fonts/

# Derived campaign bundle: byte-identical copies of files already tracked under
# assets/campaign*/ plus the JPEGs whatsapp.mjs builds from them. 4.4MB of pure
# duplication, and its own README says nothing in it ships. Rebuild, don't commit.
assets/campaign-combined/
